{"id":"Wf2e2c15249086aaa175a8a44","zh":"钢轨接头伤损","en":"","name":"钢轨接头伤损","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wf2e2c15249086aaa175a8a44","text":"钢轨接头伤损","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S00c15a7bacb7361bf48e","source_id":"P102","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"如图5(a)所示,右轴箱振动加速度的时间-小波能量谱呈现明显25m周期性峰值变化特征,特别在k0+456~k0+486段,平均振动能量大,出现严重病害的概率亦较大,应该重点关注k0+483位置及其附近的轨道结构状态,而在对应的轨道高低不平顺时间-小波能量谱中,这部分的不平顺能量并无明显变化,所以采用振动信号进行轨道病害分析更为有效;同时,经过调查,获知此段线路的钢轨长度即为标准长度25m,所以推断能量峰值由钢轨接头伤损引起。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":5,"page_end":5}]}],"sources":{"P102":{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"朔黄算例中对25m周期轴箱能量峰给出的原因解释。","language":"zh","source_id":"P102","paper_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W6f129f9e5ff4392934b89f6f","name":"rail-joint damage","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W6f129f9e5ff4392934b89f6f","name":"rail-joint damage","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"W6f129f9e5ff4392934b89f6f","name":"rail-joint damage","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"related":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.1638